---
title: "debt.accrue_interest (Pebble Protocol: Debt)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_index: assert old_borrow_index <= new_borrow_index
    q_check_index --> q_check_same: old_borrow_index == new_borrow_index?
    q_check_same --> q_skip: yes, no interest to accrue
    q_skip --> [*]: return
    q_check_same --> q_calc: no, calculate new debt
    q_calc --> q_update_amount: amount = amount * new_index / old_index
    q_update_amount --> q_update_index: borrow_index = new_borrow_index
    q_update_index --> [*]: return

    note right of q_update_amount
        INV-001: borrow_index must be monotonically non-decreasing
        INV-002: debt grows proportionally to borrow_index ratio
        INV-003: if indices are equal, debt amount unchanged (avoids division)
    end note
